      "type": "code",
      "text": "def G(n, b):\n    r = ''\n    while n > 0:\n        r = str(n % b) + r\n        n //= b\n    return r\n\nR = []\nfor x in range(1, 2030+1):\n    num = 6**2030 + 6**100 - x\n    s = G(num, 6)\n    R.append([s.count('0'), x])\n\nprint(max(R))"
    },
